.workspaces/
tmp/
db/*.db-shm
db/*.db-wal
vectors/*.tmp
# The DERIVED sqlite index and vector store. The markdown in items/, archive/ and notes/ is
# the source of truth; `mm` rebuilds these from it automatically. Tracking the db left the
# tree permanently dirty on every sync and turned routine merges into binary blob conflicts,
# while the markdown it is built from merges cleanly. Matches the memento/horos convention.
db/*.db
vectors/
sessions/
